@baseUrl = http://localhost:5188

### Obtener token (seleccionar el entorno local)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"usuario": "{{usuario}}", "contrasena": "{{contrasena}}"}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### Registrar sensor
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sensores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"ubicacion": "Zona de producción", "tipoGas": "Multiparametro"}

> {% client.global.set("sensorId", response.body.id); %}

### Registrar lectura con alerta crítica
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/lecturas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sensorId": {{sensorId}}, "pm2_5": 160, "pm10": 210, "co2": 900, "fechaHora": "2026-11-13T02:00:00Z"}

> {% client.global.set("lecturaId", response.body.lectura.id); %}

### Consultar lecturas de PM2.5
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/lecturas?sensorId={{sensorId}}&contaminante=PM2_5&desde=2026-11-13T00:00:00Z&hasta=2026-11-13T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consultar alertas del sensor
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alertas?sensorId={{sensorId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Validar rechazo de valores negativos
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/lecturas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sensorId": {{sensorId}}, "pm2_5": -1, "pm10": 20, "co2": 700, "fechaHora": "2026-11-13T02:00:00Z"}
